      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town's early growth was spurred by a 22‑member German band formed in 1908, mostly from Schleswig‑Holstein, which played until 1913.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
